        "full_name": "Oncology Sales Representative",
        "description": "The Oncology Sales (OS) Representative is a customer-facing commercial professional responsible for engaging healthcare professionals (HCPs) to communicate approved product information, understand customer needs, support the appropriate use of approved products within the approved indication, and build professional relationships through compliant promotional interactions. The OS Representative discusses approved product information, clinical evidence, efficacy, safety within promotional scope, treatment positioning, patient identification opportunities, customer feedback, and competitive insights while adhering to commercial and regulatory guidelines.",
